  "description": "Database-agnostic operational logging for .NET, built on Serilog. Persists structured application/observability log events to a SQL table via a batched, best-effort sink, with a paginated read surface and an in-process live feed. Provider-neutral — the Postgres COPY fast path and partition retention live in EasyReasy.Database.Logging.Npgsql.",
